flowchart TD
    Wire[驼峰PublicBudget] --> Strict[原Protocol严格校验]
    Strict --> Mapping[显式下划线字段转换]
    Mapping --> Domain[(原领域预算与Session事实)]
    Model[真实模型参数] --> Decode[原Workspace Patch解码]
    Decode --> Missing[缺少操作必需mode]
    Missing --> Refuse[原固定参数拒绝 不产生审批或写入]
    Domain --> Evidence[低敏字段与固定错误事实]
    Refuse --> Evidence
    Usage[原Usage和账本结算] --> Evidence
    Evidence --> Report[保留FAIL及商业NO_GO]
